    "dynamic_instructions": "{\r\n  \"datasetView\": \"**New User**\\n\\nGoal: Test your model for someone new.\\n\\n1. In **Predict** and **Using**, choose the label and Tree 2 features from **Tree 1 vs. Tree 2** in your guide.\\n2. Click **Train model**.\\n\\nYou are done when your tree shows. Go to the **Testing** tab.\",\r\n  \"results\": \"**New User**\\n\\nGoal: Test your model for someone new.\\n\\n> Ms. Lee wants to bring peach slices for the after-school snack. Peach slices are a fruit, low in calories, with almost no salt. They are high in natural sugar.\\n\\n1. In **Make a Prediction**, choose a category for each feature that fits this user. Write them in **New User** in your guide.\\n2. Click **Predict**. Write the prediction.\\n3. Compare the prediction to what this user needs. Write ✓ if it fits or ✗ if it doesn't.\\n\\nYou are done when New User in your guide is full.\"\r\n}",
